BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 514 Tm (the full sample.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 484 Tm (We then estimate multinomial logit models to examine which variables separate these states) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 470 Tm (across business-age buckets. The main explanatory variables include sales trend, maximum) Tj ET
