BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 338 Tm (behavior \(DDZ\), indicating that the canonical hump-shaped life cycle is a poor summary of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 324 Tm (most establishments. Second, the full-sample observed-window analysis yields a different but) Tj ET
