BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 296 Tm (38.2 percent as Stable, and 21.7 percent as Decline. This distribution should be interpreted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 282 Tm (as the pattern of currently observed windows among surviving stores rather than as a literal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 268 Tm (description of the initial life cycle of all businesses.) Tj ET
